# Route: guide 6 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 23 to 25, 37
# quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Loch Modan, Darkshore): Thelsamar -> Grizzlepaw Ridge -> Ironband's
# Excavation Site -> The Farstrider Lodge -> The Loch -> Thelsamar -> Valley
# of Kings -> Stonesplinter Valley -> Valley of Kings -> Stonesplinter Valley
# -> Valley of Kings -> Stonesplinter Valley -> Valley of Kings -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Mercenaries (255; Mo'grosh Ogre
# 18-19, Mo'grosh Brute 19-20, Mo'grosh Enforcer 18-19); Vyrin's Revenge (271;
# Ol' Sooty 20); WANTED: Chok'sul (256; Chok'sul 22); Baron Marinous (98028;
# Baron Marinous 21).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2501 Badlands
# Reagent Run II.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

